CORE
recursive_property1.sv
--bound 10
^file .* line 8: recursive property/sequence `.*prop_always. is not supported$
^EXIT=2$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Recursive properties (1800-2017 16.12.17) are not supported. We detect
the recursion and emit a diagnostic instead of crashing with a stack
overflow.
